      "headline": "Tornado Warning issued October 10 at 5:06PM EDT until October 10 at 5:15PM EDT by NWS Columbia SC",
      "description": "At 505 PM EDT, a confirmed tornado was located over Barnwell, moving\nnorth at 20 mph.\n\nHAZARD...Damaging tornado.\n\nSOURCE...Radar confirmed tornado.\n\nIMPACT...Flying debris will be dangerous to those caught without\nshelter. Mobile homes will be damaged or destroyed. Damage\nto roofs, windows, and vehicles will occur.  Tree damage is\nlikely.\n\nThis tornado will be near...\nBarnwell around 510 PM EDT.\n\nOther locations impacted by this tornadic thunderstorm include\nBarnwell County Airport.",
